      "preview": "דַּק²: adjetivo: delgado, pequeno, fino.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דַּק</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo: delgado, pequeno, fino</strong>—absoluto masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">דּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:14\" href=\"/Exodus.16.14\">Ex 16:14</a> + vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.30\">Lv 13:30</a>; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">Lv 16:12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.12\">1 K 19:12</a>; plural feminino absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:6\" href=\"/Genesis.41.6\">Gn 41:6</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקֹּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:24\" href=\"/Genesis.41.24\">41:24</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:3\" href=\"/Genesis.41.3\">41:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּקֹּת</span> v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:4\" href=\"/Genesis.41.4\">4</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>magro</em>, de vacas <span dir=\"rtl\">דּ׳ בָּשָׂר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:3\" href=\"/Genesis.41.3\">Gn 41:3</a> cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:4\" href=\"/Genesis.41.4\">4</a> (Sam tem em ambos <span dir=\"rtl\">רַקּוֹת</span> cf. TM v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:19\" href=\"/Genesis.41.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:20\" href=\"/Genesis.41.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:27\" href=\"/Genesis.41.27\">27</a>); de espigas de cereal v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:6\" href=\"/Genesis.41.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:7\" href=\"/Genesis.41.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:23\" href=\"/Genesis.41.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:24\" href=\"/Genesis.41.24\">24</a> (todos E); <em>magro, encolhido, mirrado</em>, de homem <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 21:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.21.20\">Lv 21:20</a> (H).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>pequeno, fino</em>, do maná <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּק מְחֻסְפָּס דַּק כַּכְּפֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:14\" href=\"/Exodus.16.14\">Ex 16:14</a>; do incenso <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.12\">Lv 16:12</a>, do cabelo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.30\">13:30</a> (todos P); do pó <span dir=\"rtl\">אָבָק דַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.5\">Is 29:5</a>; em símile das ilhas na mão de <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִיִּים כַּדַּק יִטּוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.15\">Is 40:15</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּק</span> = substantivo <em>coisa fina, pó fino</em>); uma vez acerca de um murmúrio suave <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹל דְּמָמָה דַקָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.12\">1 K 19:12</a>.",
